[en.FOCUS_C02_PONYVILLE_RESEARCH]
Stallioncon Valley Research Center

[en.FOCUS_C02_PONYVILLE_RESEARCH_desc]
Dr. Hooves’s Lab is a renowned research institution in Equestria and even the whole world. But this institution is only supported by the power of Dr. Hooves, a single pony.\nTherefore, if we expand the scale of this institution and build a new research center in Stallioncon Valley, it will greatly help to improve the status of Ponyville in the field of scientific research.

[zh.FOCUS_C02_PONYVILLE_RESEARCH]
骏马谷科研中心

[zh.FOCUS_C02_PONYVILLE_RESEARCH_desc]
蹄博士实验室是小马国乃至整个世界上享誉盛名的科研机构，但这一机构只依靠蹄博士一只小马的力量支撑着。\n因此，如果我们扩大这一机构的规模，在骏马谷建设新的科研中心，将会大大有助于提高小马谷在科研领域的地位。

